{"seq":1,"slug":"rivers-lakes-hydrology","title":"河流与湖泊水文：地表水的运动与结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/surface-groundwater/rivers-lakes-hydrology","wordCount":1450,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"河流与湖泊水文-地表水的运动与结构\">河流与湖泊水文：地表水的运动与结构</h1><p>一条河在峡谷里湍急、在平原上舒缓，一个深湖在夏天上热下冷、在秋天突然「翻个底朝天」——地表水看得见摸得着，却藏着一整套水力学与热力学规律。当 <a href=\"../hydrological-cycle/runoff-watershed\">径流与流域</a> 把水汇成河流之后，水就进入了具体的水体，开始以明渠流动和湖泊分层的方式运动。本篇聚焦地表水这一「快水」系统：河流如何流、泥沙如何被搬运、湖泊如何分层，为后续的水质、配置与防洪提供描述对象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>地表水系统的核心是流动与停滞两种状态：河流是流动的线性水体，关键是流速与流量的关系；湖泊水库是相对停滞的体状水体，关键是垂向的温度与密度结构。两者通过河道连接，共同构成地表水网络。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[&quot;流域产流&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;河道明渠流&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; C[&quot;流速 v&lt;br/&gt;曼宁公式&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; D[&quot;泥沙输移&quot;]&#10;  B --&gt; E[&quot;入湖/入库&quot;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[&quot;湖泊水库&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[&quot;温度分层&quot;]&#10;  G --&gt; H[&quot;季节性翻转&quot;]&#10;  F --&gt; I[&quot;出流回到河道&quot;]&#10;  D --&gt; J[&quot;河床演变&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n  A[\"流域产流\"] --&gt; B[\"河道明渠流\"]\n  B --&gt; C[\"流速 v&lt;br/&gt;曼宁公式\"]\n  B --&gt; D[\"泥沙输移\"]\n  B --&gt; E[\"入湖/入库\"]\n  E --&gt; F[\"湖泊水库\"]\n  F --&gt; G[\"温度分层\"]\n  G --&gt; H[\"季节性翻转\"]\n  F --&gt; I[\"出流回到河道\"]\n  D --&gt; J[\"河床演变\"]</pre><p>下表对比河流与湖泊两类地表水体的关键特征，凸显它们截然不同的研究侧重。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>河流</th>\n<th>湖泊/水库</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主导运动</td>\n<td>单向明渠流动</td>\n<td>缓慢混合与分层</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滞留时间</td>\n<td>短（天到周）</td>\n<td>长（月到年）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>关键描述量</td>\n<td>流速、流量、水位</td>\n<td>温度剖面、溶解氧、营养盐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>核心公式/规律</td>\n<td>曼宁公式、连续方程</td>\n<td>密度分层、季节翻转</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"河道水力学-曼宁公式与流量\">河道水力学：曼宁公式与流量</h2><p>河流在天然河道中的流动属于明渠流（open channel flow），其最实用的描述是曼宁公式，它把流速与河道的水力特征联系起来：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\frac{1}{n} R^{2/3} S^{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2/3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.938em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是断面平均流速，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是糙率系数（反映河床粗糙程度，卵石河床比光滑混凝土大得多），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span> 是水力半径（过水断面积除以湿周），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span> 是水力坡度。流量则由连续方程 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = vA</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 给出，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 为过水断面积。</p>\n<p>曼宁公式的价值在于把难以直接测量的流量，转化为相对易测的水位—断面关系。实践中，水文站通过建立水位—流量关系曲线（rating curve），用连续监测的水位反推流量，这是河流监测的基础工作流。值得注意的是糙率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 并非常数，它随水位、植被、河床形态变化，是天然河道流量计算的主要不确定性来源。河流的流量过程正是 <a href=\"../water-resources-management/assessment-allocation-iwrm\">水资源评价与配置</a> 中地表水可利用量的直接依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"泥沙输移与河床演变\">泥沙输移与河床演变</h2><p>河流不只搬运水，还搬运泥沙，泥沙输移塑造了河床形态、影响着水库寿命与航道维护。泥沙按运动方式分为悬移质（悬浮在水中随流而下）和推移质（沿河床滚动、跳跃前进）。水流的挟沙能力随流速急剧上升——这正是为什么洪水期河流浑浊、能搬运平时搬不动的巨石。</p>\n<p>当水流进入水库或平缓段，流速骤降，挟沙能力下降，泥沙便沉积下来，造成水库淤积、库容损失。黄河之所以成为「地上悬河」，正是高含沙量长期淤积抬高河床的结果。泥沙问题把河流水文与水利工程紧紧绑在一起：大坝拦截泥沙会改变下游河道冲淤平衡，这一权衡是 <a href=\"../water-resources-management/water-supply-engineering\">供水与水利工程</a> 中水库设计必须面对的难题。泥沙还是污染物的载体，许多重金属和磷吸附在颗粒上随泥沙迁移，关联到 <a href=\"water-quality-ecology\">水质与水生态</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"湖泊的热分层与季节翻转\">湖泊的热分层与季节翻转</h2><p>湖泊与水库作为相对静止的深水体，会因水的密度随温度变化而产生垂向分层。水在约 4°C 时密度最大，这一反常特性主导了温带深湖的季节循环。夏季，表层水被太阳晒热、密度变小，浮在上层（变温层 epilimnion），下层是冷而密的滞水层（hypolimnion），中间是温度急剧变化的温跃层（thermocline）——三层之间几乎不交换。</p>\n<p>入秋后表层降温，当上下温度趋同、密度一致时，一阵风就能让整个湖体上下翻转混合，这就是秋季翻转（turnover），它把表层的氧气带入深层、把深层的营养盐带到表层。这一分层与翻转机制深刻影响水质：夏季分层期下层因与大气隔绝、有机物分解耗氧，常出现缺氧甚至无氧，导致底泥释放磷、铁、锰，恶化水质。因此湖泊分层不是纯物理现象，它是理解富营养化与水库供水水质季节波动的钥匙，相关水质过程在 <a href=\"water-quality-ecology\">水质与水生态</a> 中展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>地表水系统的要点可归纳如下：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((地表水系统))&#10;    河流&#10;      明渠流&#10;      曼宁公式&#10;      水位流量关系&#10;    泥沙&#10;      悬移质&#10;      推移质&#10;      水库淤积&#10;    湖泊水库&#10;      热分层三层&#10;      秋季翻转&#10;      底层缺氧\">mindmap\n  root((地表水系统))\n    河流\n      明渠流\n      曼宁公式\n      水位流量关系\n    泥沙\n      悬移质\n      推移质\n      水库淤积\n    湖泊水库\n      热分层三层\n      秋季翻转\n      底层缺氧</pre><ul>\n<li>地表水分为流动的河流与相对停滞的湖泊水库两类，前者重水力学、后者重热力学分层。</li>\n<li>曼宁公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>n</mi></mfrac><msup><mi>R</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi>S</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = \\frac{1}{n} R^{2/3} S^{1/2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.233em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2/3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1/2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 把流速与河道糙率、水力半径、坡度联系起来；水位—流量关系曲线是河流流量监测的基础，糙率变化是主要不确定性。</li>\n<li>泥沙分悬移质与推移质，挟沙能力随流速急升，沉积造成水库淤积，并把河流与水利工程、水质问题联系起来。</li>\n<li>湖泊因水在 4°C 密度最大而产生夏季三层分层，秋季翻转重新混合全湖；分层期下层缺氧是水质恶化的重要机制。</li>\n<li>河流与湖泊为后续的水质评价、水资源配置和水利工程提供了被描述、被利用的具体对象。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"河流与湖泊水文：地表水的运动与结构","id":"河流与湖泊水文-地表水的运动与结构"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"河道水力学：曼宁公式与流量","id":"河道水力学-曼宁公式与流量"},{"level":2,"text":"泥沙输移与河床演变","id":"泥沙输移与河床演变"},{"level":2,"text":"湖泊的热分层与季节翻转","id":"湖泊的热分层与季节翻转"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"径流与流域：水的横向汇聚","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/hydrological-cycle/runoff-watershed"},"next":{"title":"地下水与含水层：达西定律与井流","url":"/l-doc-books/h/environmental-science/hydrology-water-resources/surface-groundwater/groundwater-aquifers"}}